A.3 Source file header template:

    /*
     * This file is based on and modifies "Flist-lite".
     * Original project: https://github.com/YGPTDR-web/flist-lite
     * Copyright 2026 YGPTDR-web (https://github.com/YGPTDR-web)
     * Licensed under the Flist-lite Non-Commercial Share-Alike License 1.0;
     * see LICENSE. Modifications: <what changed>  Date: <YYYY-MM-DD>
     */

A.4 Notes. (a) Replace the repository URL with the original repository you
    actually used. (b) The modifications statement must truthfully describe your
    changes and may not be left blank or say "none". (c) Attribution must not
    name a legal entity you do not own or represent. (d) With multiple upstream
    authors, use one line each rather than combining them.

